      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I can see the mutuals of someone that has had me blocked for a couple of years.\n\nThe mututals seem to become hidden if I am in the same instance as the person  though, and seems to remain hidden for the rest of the session.\n\nBut restarting the client seems to then allow me to look at the mutuals again, unless I encounter them again.",
