  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-11-11T06:30:10.179Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Block a User.\n\n2. View their Mutual Friends.\n\n3. Get blocked.\n\n4. View their Mutual Friends.\n\nThis seems like a pretty big privacy oversight, as I doubt anyone would want blocked users looking up mutual friends to harass or co-opt into being intermediates. \n\nFor context: Not even Discord allows this with it's mutual friends feature.",
